,"攻击者利用 PHP2Shell 入侵 Check Point 网关并部署 VMware ESXi 数据擦除器","2026-11-15",18,"CISA 将 Check Point 与 UnrealIRCd 漏洞 CVE-2026-123039、CVE-2026-114713 加入 KEV 目录","2026-11-16",19,"FBI 警告 ARTEX AI 渗透测试框架被用于全球多行业攻击","2026-11-17",20,"Rapid7发现CVE-2026-90436已被用于攻击Atlassian Confluence Data Center和N-able N-central","2026-11-18",21,"OpenJDK Java4Shell 漏洞 CVE-2026-114938 可导致 RCE，Oracle 已发布补丁","2026-11-19",22,"OpenJDK 披露 Base64 解码远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-114938","2026-11-20",23,"VMware vCenter 认证绕过漏洞 CVE-2026-123890 已被 ARMORY CASTLE 利用",24,"Microsoft Outlook 欺骗漏洞 CVE-2026-124194 已复现并遭在野利用","kind","daily","安全日报 · 2026-11-05","generatedAt","2026-11-05T00:00:20.328Z","lead",{"_49":62,"_328":284},"leadItemId","kodarv143bm6tdtz8vpt6lz9c","overview","highlights",[325,326,327],"sections",[232,233,234],"flashes",[144,145,146,147,148,149,150,151,152,153],"cover",{"_137":138,"_139":140,"_141":-5,"_142":-5,"_143":-5},"metrics",{"_133":73,"_134":61,"_135":44,"_136":46},"readingMinutes","prev","next","totalEvents","sourcesCount","modelsReleased","firstPartyEvents","url","/dailyinfo/media/40b36133e5932f60.jpg","srcSet","/dailyinfo/media/40fa20f4bba72907.jpg 720w, /dailyinfo/media/0c35a36610a1d0e2.jpg 1200w, /dailyinfo/media/40b36133e5932f60.jpg 1600w","width","height","caption",{"_154":227,"_49":228,"_157":229,"_159":184,"_161":230,"_163":231,"_165":187,"_167":188,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":222,"_49":223,"_157":224,"_159":184,"_161":225,"_163":226,"_165":187,"_167":188,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":215,"_49":216,"_157":217,"_159":218,"_161":219,"_163":220,"_165":-5,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_221":46},{"_154":210,"_49":211,"_157":212,"_159":176,"_161":213,"_163":214,"_165":179,"_167":180,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":205,"_49":206,"_157":207,"_159":176,"_161":208,"_163":209,"_165":179,"_167":180,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":197,"_49":198,"_157":199,"_159":200,"_161":201,"_163":202,"_165":203,"_167":204,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":189,"_49":190,"_157":191,"_159":192,"_161":193,"_163":194,"_165":195,"_167":196,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":181,"_49":182,"_157":183,"_159":184,"_161":185,"_163":186,"_165":187,"_167":188,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":173,"_49":174,"_157":175,"_159":176,"_161":177,"_163":178,"_165":179,"_167":180,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":155,"_49":156,"_157":158,"_159":160,"_161":162,"_163":164,"_165":166,"_167":168,"_169":170,"_171":172},"itemId","jvtor8kv1gcbr27p74mjz9r0c","SentinelLabs 开源 VerifiedIDA，规范 LLM 驱动的二进制逆向分析","summary","SentinelLabs 开源 VerifiedIDA，用于在 IDA Pro 中规范 LLM 驱动的逆向分析。研究基于 Anthropic、OpenAI 及开源模型对恶意与合法二进制的评估，指出模型虽较少编造，却会产生失真标签、遗漏已确认发现、因上下文压缩丢失未完成任务，并可能在相关代码尚未全部检查时提前停止。","sourceName","SentinelLabs","sourceUrl","https://www.sentinelone.com/labs/verifiedida-making-llm-driven-reverse-engineering-inspectable-continuable-and-reusable/","publishedAt","2026-11-04T14:00:03.000Z","sourceIconUrl","/dailyinfo/media/02d46ef457cae4f6.webp","sourceIconSrcSet","/dailyinfo/media/6e0f0ba7134795c9.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/02d46ef457cae4f6.webp 96w","firstParty",false,"available",true,"phzcemc8tw3yd552qu2tv54yf","Goddess of Victory: NIKKE PC 启动器遭供应链投毒，分发远程访问与数据窃取恶意软件","Goddess of Victory: NIKKE PC 启动器遭第三方篡改并被用于分发恶意软件。","BleepingComputer","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/nikke-pc-game-launcher-hacked-to-spread-remote-access-data-stealing-malware/","2026-11-04T16:58:46.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3a544a742516b0af.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/198a4d86de90e233.webp 96w","zynn0l5n2718mxkwqnvyjfsaz","Ruby on Rails Active Storage 严重漏洞可经 ImageMagick 上传写入服务器文件","Ruby on Rails 披露 Active Storage 严重漏洞 GHSA-f3w6-w445-fwh9，CVSS 评分为 9.8；使用 ImageMagick 处理不可信上传的应用可被未认证攻击者利用，攻击者仅需附加文件即可触发任意文件写入，使用 Disk 服务的应用还可能泄露可读文件。","The Hacker News","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/critical-rails-flaw-lets-attackers.html","2026-11-04T12:07:04.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg","/dailyinfo/media/a1e7de8b6809b50e.jpg 48w, /dailyinfo/media/3d21685a726d0a64.jpg 96w","sfvo8e4znikbyrkswxyxhp22z","网络攻击扰乱法国三家血库及欧洲八国超市制冷系统","网络攻击扰乱法国 EFS 三家区域血液机构的冷库监控与控制系统，事件发生于周日至周一夜间；工作人员将血液制品转移至未受影响的冰箱，避免了供应中断。法国卫生部表示局势已受控并禁用了受影响冰箱的远程访问，具体受影响设备、系统恢复时间及攻击入口仍在调查。","Security Affairs","https://securityaffairs.com/202431/hacking/cyberattack-hits-french-blood-banks-as-hackers-target-refrigeration-systems-across-europe.html","2026-11-04T19:01:57.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp","/dailyinfo/media/2adef5b1e4357a03.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/ef2b2b57fb06e54f.webp 96w","tuz4xq6m0e8l8ro96finsn6q3","法国血液采集机构 EFS 旗下 3 家血库因制冷供应商遭网络攻击出现温度异常","法国血液采集机构 EFS 旗下 3 家血库在针对其制冷设备供应商的网络攻击后检测到冷库温度异常，并已逆转温升，未发现样本或血制品变质，血液采集与分发未受影响。EFS 表示其冷藏库覆盖向法国约 1,900 家医疗机构的供血，但该供应商并非事件直接目标。","Help Net Security","https://www.helpnetsecurity.com/2026/11/04/cyberattack-hits-french-blood-banks/","2026-11-04T13:36:50.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp","/dailyinfo/media/9c1b5fa87b3bafc5.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/06c9ab9de6dbb6a5.webp 96w","sqpejfy24tujmwbg86c963iio","DreamHost确认数据泄露，FTP/SFTP凭据与部分webmail会话信息遭窃取","DreamHost确认，攻击者利用File Manager漏洞访问files.dreamhost.com并窃取客户FTP/SFTP用户名和密码，入侵从2026年8月持续至2026年10月23日；有限数量用户的webmail会话信息及凭据也可能被访问。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/dreamhost-confirms-data-breach-exposed-ftp-logins-and-webmail-sessions/","2026-11-04T19:05:19.000Z","raplffq74z8003qt5fzx9tnuk","Zyxel 修复 CVE-2026-107441，漏洞已被用于入侵全球近 1,000 台 GS1900 交换机","Zyxel 已修复 GS1900 网络交换机漏洞 CVE-2026-107441，攻击者已利用该漏洞在全球 48 个国家入侵 996 台设备并窃取配置文件、哈希 root 凭据和网络信息。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/zyxel-fixes-zero-day-exploited-to-hack-nearly-1-000-network-switches/","2026-11-04T20:58:19.000Z","nbb7tcoqtiahxd3n8hixn7hov","海鸥 4.5.0 越狱包利用 Codex 全局配置持久化注入中转站广告","海鸥 Codex 捆绑包 4.5.0 通过加密 payload.pkg 向 ~/.codex/AGENTS.md 等可信配置写入模块化提示词和六个 seagull-* Skills，使“hi”等触发词可激活固定中转站广告。","奇安信威胁情报中心","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzI2MDc2MDA4OA==&mid=2247521227&idx=1&sn=fb670b1f78e18163923f6b726b86d76b","2026-11-04T08:17:00.000Z","otherSources","zywos2goavsrxtbxb5b5qemy2","Xen Hypervisor 漏洞 CVE-2026-102703 和 CVE-2026-102704 可使恶意 VM 读写其他 VM 内存","Xen Hypervisor 的 CVE-2026-102703 和 CVE-2026-102704 可使同一主机上的恶意虚拟机读写其他 VM 内存，包括拥有完整管理权限的 dom0；所有 4.6 及以上版本受影响，4.5 及更早版本不受影响，漏洞编号对应 XSA-523。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/xen-hypervisor-flaws-let-one-malicious.html","2026-11-04T11:46:27.000Z","i8223e2tec5uzjjmomfmhe70i","Debian 与 Ubuntu APT 漏洞 CVE-2026-109518 可让中间人替换软件包并以 root 执行代码","Debian 与 Ubuntu 的 APT 包管理器存在漏洞 CVE-2026-109518，可修改下载流量的攻击者能利用 HTTP 重定向和临时服务器错误触发重试，替换已校验软件包并在安装时以 root 执行代码。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/debian-and-ubuntu-apt-flaw-lets-mitm.html","2026-11-04T17:00:46.000Z",{"_235":287,"_157":-5,"_237":288},{"_235":248,"_157":-5,"_237":249},{"_235":236,"_157":-5,"_237":238},"label","研究与披露","items",[239],{"_154":240,"_49":241,"_157":242,"_159":243,"_161":244,"_163":245,"_165":246,"_167":247,"_169":170,"_171":172},"akw79leby5nbvemb6mqo9vtdk","某国产 ERP 未授权任意文件上传 0day 被用于 Weax 勒索，3.8 万资产暴露","某国产 ERP 的未授权任意文件上传 0day 已被用于 Weax 勒索活动，攻击者无需账号密码即可上传 webshell 并加密数据，CVSS 3.1 评分为 9.8（Critical）。","先知社区","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93089","2026-11-02T09:53:14.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp","/api/img-proxy?u=https%3A%2F%2Fxz.aliyun.com%2Ffavicon.ico&mode=avatar-48&exp=1796256000&sig=862a26438132b835 48w, /dailyinfo/media/976ac253540515ec.webp 96w","攻击与威胁",[250,251,252,253,254,255],{"_154":118,"_49":62,"_157":284,"_159":184,"_161":285,"_163":286,"_165":187,"_167":188,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_221":46},{"_154":276,"_49":277,"_157":278,"_159":279,"_161":280,"_163":281,"_165":282,"_167":283,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":271,"_49":272,"_157":273,"_159":184,"_161":274,"_163":275,"_165":187,"_167":188,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_221":42},{"_154":266,"_49":267,"_157":268,"_159":243,"_161":269,"_163":270,"_165":246,"_167":247,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":261,"_49":262,"_157":263,"_159":176,"_161":264,"_163":265,"_165":179,"_167":180,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_221":42},{"_154":256,"_49":257,"_157":258,"_159":176,"_161":259,"_163":260,"_165":179,"_167":180,"_169":170,"_171":172},"m3f4nnw16zmvoc10ccus1uoni","Operation CloudFire 利用 Google Calendar 邀请劫持会话并绕过 MFA","Material Security 披露 Operation CloudFire 自 2026 年 8 月中旬起以 Google Calendar 邀请钓鱼，通过 Google 跳转链接、Cloudflare Turnstile 和动态密码捕获页搭建实时反向代理，截获 SMS、身份验证器、Tap-Yes 验证及账户恢复信息，绕过 MFA。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/google-calendar-phishing-campaign-hijacks-sessions-bypasses-mfa/","2026-11-04T15:00:10.000Z","s26g6gohs13ucgf78y89lf009","法国国家血液服务机构因供应商遭网络攻击而中断 3 处冷库温控","法国国家血液服务机构 EFS 确认，其制冷设备供应商 Coolworld Rentals 遭网络攻击后，3 处设施的冷库温控与除霜阈值被远程调至极高水平，事件发生于 November 2，EFS 于 November 3 发布声明。","https://www.bleepingcomputer.com/news/security/cyberattack-disrupts-blood-storage-refrigeration-systems-in-france/","2026-11-04T18:02:56.000Z","lwcixiqc5m9dfywyen2fk41o2","第三方运维私开 RDP 端口致企业遭 LockBit 勒索与内网 SMB 爆破","Solar 应急响应团队披露，某企业因第三方运维将 B 主机的 3389 端口映射至公网，被攻击者利用资产测绘信息踩点并登录，随后投放 5-NS、netpass64、加密器 Stub 及清日志脚本，对内网 445 端口实施 SMB 爆破并加密 A、B 两台 Windows 服务器。","https://xz.aliyun.com/news/93088","2026-11-02T09:13:02.000Z","bllxbimaqy07wxo071cy443js","SlippyNunchucks 劫持搜狗输入法 DNS 请求部署 DarkVigil 后门","ESET 披露中国关联威胁组织 SlippyNunchucks 自 2026 年 7 月 1 日起劫持 Windows 版搜狗输入法的 DNS 请求，向香港、泰国、日本、越南、阿曼和斯里兰卡的组织及中文用户投放 DarkVigil 后门。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/china-aligned-hackers-hijack-sogou.html","2026-11-04T11:24:31.000Z","vfjzof1znh41318lorrvydjkt","Mandiant 披露大模型劫持黑产，企业单日损失或超 10 万美元","Mandiant 报告称，攻击者通过盗取企业的大模型 API 密钥或劫持访问权限盗用算力，单个受害企业每日损失可能超过 10 万美元，部分企业累计损失达 100 万美元。","安全内参","https://www.secrss.com/articles/95358","2026-11-04T09:37:27.530Z","/dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp","/dailyinfo/media/3399ea7b18d18a6a.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/77459fcbf8f21e71.webp 96w","Sekoia 称，俄罗斯关联威胁组织 APT29 借被入侵网站、仿冒域名和乌克兰 Plerdy SEO Tracker 供应链攻击开展名为 Poisoned Source 的水坑活动，向 iOS 与 Android 用户投递 N-day 利用链并窃取浏览器 Cookie、Wi-Fi 密码及移动设备数据。","https://thehackernews.com/2026/11/apt29-linked-hackers-hijack-web.html","2026-11-04T14:27:52.000Z","漏洞与在野利用",[289,290,291,292,293],{"_154":318,"_49":319,"_157":320,"_159":321,"_161":322,"_163":323,"_165":-5,"_169":172,"_171":172,"_221":42,"_324":45},{"_154":310,"_49":311,"_157":312,"_159":313,"_161":314,"_163":315,"_165":316,"_167":317,"_169":172,"_171":172},{"_154":305,"_49":306,"_157":307,"_159":192,"_161":308,"_163":309,"_165":195,"_167":196,"_169":170,"_171":172,"_221":46},{"_154":300,"_49":301,"_157":302,"_159":192,"_161":303,"_163":304,"_165":195,"_167":196,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":294,"_49":295,"_157":296,"_159":297,"_161":298,"_163":299,"_165":-5,"_169":172,"_171":172},"nuymmb6dnd20wlrfxamgfgjgq","Cisco 披露 Node.js 与 Brotli 漏洞影响通告，涉及 CVE-2026-111497 等4项","Cisco 披露 Node.js 与 Brotli 中4个安全影响等级为 High 的漏洞：CVE-2026-111497 为 Brotli 解码器越界写，存在潜在 RCE，CVE-2026-105482 涉及 DNS 解析截断，CVE-2026-105483 和 CVE-2026-106069 为 TLS 主机名验证绕过。","Cisco PSIRT","https://sec.cloudapps.cisco.com/security/center/content/CiscoSecurityAdvisory/cisco-sa-oct2026-node-js-Jj3SQ19u?vs_f=Cisco%20Security%20Advisory%26vs_cat=Security%20Intelligence%26vs_type=RSS%26vs_p=Vulnerabilities%20in%20Node.js%20and%20Brotli%20Affecting%20Cisco%20Products:%20October%202026%26vs_k=1","2026-11-04T10:52:10.000Z","ybam9buweaqo8o2mqaa7o5mm1","Android CVE-2026-58868 存在在野利用，Google 已发布修复","CVE-2026-58868 影响运行 Android 14 至 17 的设备，可因 FrameDecoder.cpp 的 onOutputReceived 函数发生堆缓冲区溢出和越界写入，在无需用户交互及额外执行权限的情况下实现 RCE。","https://securityaffairs.com/202414/mobile-2/cve-2026-58868-critical-android-bug-could-let-attackers-run-remote-code.html","2026-11-04T10:26:52.000Z","p9mnajvale4nc1xu4o2dinr5e","CISA 将 WordPress 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-119977 加入 KEV 目录","CISA 将 WordPress 远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-119977 加入 KEV 目录，该漏洞 CVSS 8.1，影响 WordPress 4.7 至 7.1.3。","https://securityaffairs.com/202394/security/u-s-cisa-adds-wordpress-flaw-to-its-known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog-2.html","2026-11-04T09:16:37.000Z","bsx5y5ksndfw7vcppci6fz4rt","Arc 的 DuckDB I/O 别名可绕过数据库 RBAC","Arc 在 v26.06.1-36 中对 CVE-2026-47735 的修复不完整，任意已认证令牌即使权限为 `permissions: []`，仍可调用 `parquet_scan(`、`glob(`、`parquet_metadata(`、`read_blob(` 等 DuckDB I/O 函数读取或枚举共享存储根目录内其他数据库的数据、模式及统计信息。","GitHub 安全公告","https://github.com/advisories/GHSA-93cm-2v4m-c56c","2026-11-04T17:02:37.000Z","/dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp","/dailyinfo/media/f426f4f60d806c23.webp 48w, /dailyinfo/media/6d6a98e6b62e0bb2.webp 96w","p0n6ok2brl2a0nzaveu5s7rhg","WordPress Core CVE-2026-119977 竞争条件 RCE 漏洞已复现并发现利用","WordPress Core 竞争条件远程代码执行漏洞 CVE-2026-119977 已被奇安信 CERT 成功复现，并监测到在野利用；CVSS 3.1 分数为 8.1，评级高危，PoC 与技术细节均已公开。","奇安信 CERT","https://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzU5NDgxODU1MQ==&mid=2247508010&idx=1&sn=7907e2aaa98df6d9be2a950b5064bac4","2026-11-04T09:26:00.000Z","followUp",{"_154":240,"_49":241,"_157":242,"_159":243,"_161":244,"_163":245,"_165":246,"_167":247,"_169":170,"_171":172},{"_154":318,"_49":319,"_157":320,"_159":321,"_161":322,"_163":323,"_165":-5,"_169":172,"_171":172,"_221":42,"_324":45},{"_154":310,"_49":311,"_157":312,"_159":313,"_161":314,"_163":315,"_165":316,"_167":317,"_169":172,"_171":172},"leadParagraph",{"_330":331,"_332":-5},"changelogVersion","2026-10-01T08:00","release"]
